This is an unofficial third-party Electron wrapper for the Proton Calendar
web app (https://calendar.proton.me). It is not endorsed by or affiliated
with Proton AG. "Proton" and "Proton Calendar" are trademarks of Proton AG.

This project bundles no Proton code or assets other than the icon in
assets/icon-source.png, which is a copy of Proton's own publicly served PWA icon
(https://calendar.proton.me/assets/android-chrome-512x512.png). It only
loads the Proton Calendar web app in an Electron window at runtime. Your
use of Proton Calendar remains subject to Proton's own Terms of Service.
